Flow:

```text
User taps Start Live
        ↓
Flutter
        ↓
Firebase Cloud Function
        ↓
Cloudflare Stream
        ↓
Create/prepare live input
        ↓
Return required stream information
        ↓
Establish broadcaster streaming session
        ↓
Start actual stream
        ↓
Confirm streaming session
        ↓
Update Firestore status = live
```

### Important

Do NOT set Firestore status to `live` before the actual streaming session has successfully started.

