# 17. Viewer Count

Viewer count must be implemented separately from normal live metadata.

Create something similar to:

```text
ViewerPresenceService
ViewerPresenceRepository
```

Do NOT perform excessive Firestore writes for every viewer event.

Keep viewer presence isolated from the rest of the application.

The architecture should allow migration later to a scalable presence system such as Redis or another real-time solution.

